    <!-- Info Sheet -->
    <string name="info_title">Privacy and info</string>
    <string name="info_body_1">Your chats are saved to your account so they are right where you left them, even on a new device. Only you can see them. Delete a chat and it is gone permanently.</string>
    <string name="info_body_2">To respond, your messages are processed securely. They are used only to respond to you, and conversations are never read.</string>
    <string name="info_body_3">We track basic usage metrics to ensure Mitra is functioning well, never the content of your messages.</string>
    <string name="info_disclaimer">Mitra is a friend to talk to, not a therapist or doctor. If things feel heavy, talking to someone you trust or calling Tele-MANAS (14416, free 24/7) can help.</string>
